{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_spnq_4_1","chapterId":"ch_work_spnq_4","text":"●卷三◎帝王部·名讳","sortOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_spnq_4_2","chapterId":"ch_work_spnq_4","text":"◎帝王部·名讳","sortOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_spnq_4_3","chapterId":"ch_work_spnq_4","text":"周官小史掌王之名讳名讳之起繇周道也。上古帝王敦尚质朴名號雖建製度未備故尧舜則有放勋重華之名而禹湯。又去唐虞之文從高陽之质以名為號先儒之說，或以為名，或以為字，或以為謚而尚書所紀即皆褒德之稱蓋傳述之異也。自漢以來所記詳矣。至。若貴易讳而難知避五行之勝伏亦皆有旨焉。","sortOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_spnq_4_4","chapterId":"ch_work_spnq_4","text":"黃帝名曰：軒轅蓋受國於有熊居軒轅之丘因以為名。又以為號。又雲：作軒冕之服故謂之軒轅。","sortOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_spnq_4_5","chapterId":"ch_work_spnq_4","text":"少昊名挚字青陽。","sortOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_spnq_4_6","chapterId":"ch_work_spnq_4","text":"颛頊高陽。","sortOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_spnq_4_7","chapterId":"ch_work_spnq_4","text":"帝喾高辛（高陽高辛皆所興之地名颛頊與喾皆以字為號上古质故也。）。","sortOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_spnq_4_8","chapterId":"ch_work_spnq_4","text":"帝挚。","sortOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_spnq_4_9","chapterId":"ch_work_spnq_4","text":"帝尧名放勋。","sortOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_spnq_4_10","chapterId":"ch_work_spnq_4","text":"帝舜名重華。","sortOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_spnq_4_11","chapterId":"ch_work_spnq_4","text":"夏禹名文命。","sortOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_spnq_4_12","chapterId":"ch_work_spnq_4","text":"帝啟。","sortOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_spnq_4_13","chapterId":"ch_work_spnq_4","text":"帝太康。","sortOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_spnq_4_14","chapterId":"ch_work_spnq_4","text":"帝仲康。","sortOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_spnq_4_15","chapterId":"ch_work_spnq_4","text":"帝相。","sortOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_spnq_4_16","chapterId":"ch_work_spnq_4","text":"帝少康。","sortOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_spnq_4_17","chapterId":"ch_work_spnq_4","text":"帝寧（一作杼）。","sortOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_spnq_4_18","chapterId":"ch_work_spnq_4","text":"帝槐。","sortOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_spnq_4_19","chapterId":"ch_work_spnq_4","text":"帝芒。","sortOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_spnq_4_20","chapterId":"ch_work_spnq_4","text":"帝泄。","sortOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_spnq_4_21","chapterId":"ch_work_spnq_4","text":"帝不降。","sortOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_spnq_4_22","cha